      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#F273E0>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> drawer.BeginLine(p),
    AppendPoint(p), EndLine(), DeleteLast(), DeleteAll(); reactive PointCount and
    Distance; OnLineStarted(Vector3), OnLineCreated(LineRenderer).\n<color=#F273E0>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select Draw: every setting is an Inspector field. PointCount.OnChanged
    and Distance.OnChanged feed the value labels; Undo and Clear call Drawer directly.\n<color=#F273E0>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Drag in the scene: Points and Length count while drawing,
    release logs OnLineCreated. Smoothing, width and collider apply to the next stroke."
